`,s.jsx(t.p,{children:"You might have already known about Chess.com, but for the uninitiated, it’s a popular online chess platform where you can play chess with people around the world. One of the features they provide is game analysis. After you finish a game, you can analyze it to see how well you played, and where you could have improved. It has free & paid tiers, and obviously, the paid tier has better analysis quality."}),`
`,s.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Chess.com uses ",s.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Stockfish engine"})," for analysis. Stockfish is an open-source chess engine, that can evaluate chess positions and play as an opponent. One of the strongest chess engines out there. ",s.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Top_Chess_Engine_Championship",children:"More than half of engine competitions are won by Stockfish!!"}),"."]}),`
